1. Gates: UBSan dropped (it instruments C in clang's front end, so it checks nothing on LLVM IR input; ASan stays); every slice-0 gate time bound now goes through bounded_run (scripts/checks/lib/bounded.sh) instead of GNU timeout (slice0_common.sh `bounded`, slice0_repro.sh); a report-only compile-time table (compile_times.tsv: emit and native wall-clock ms next to their budgets).
