 The first layer of the adapter proof: each BIR instruction's expansion computes, in LCB's 32-bit
@@ -1993,6 +2007,44 @@ theorem adapter_correct {p : Program} (hwf : WF p) {f : Source.Function}
     | diverges => exact hb.symm
